# End-to-end keystroke-to-present latency (SC-009): open the 100k-character fixture and type 500 characters
# at the end of a stable line. Paths are relative to this script's directory.
open ../../fixtures/perf/100k.txt
key home+ctrl
repeat 5
key down
end
key end
repeat 10
type  typing fifty characters into a stable line again
end
sample
exit
